ans were reportedly  searching for when they hacked into  those state computers last year put  these stories together and you can see  warnings that Trump may be planning to  consoie  with Russia about the next elections  evidently even Trump realized this 8:45  p.m. July 9th the fact that President  Putin and I discussed a cybersecurity  unit doesn't mean I think it can happen  it can't we had never seen Donald Trump  truly scared before we have now scared  enough to back away from an agreement  that might have been treasonous he may  have been scared as much by his son's  tone-deaf confession as by his own  junior first denied ever meeting with  any Russians during the campaign then  caught hosting a Kremlin length legal  thug and Jared Kushner and Paul Manafort  on June 9th 2016 he said it was a  throwaway meeting about Americans  adopting Russian children then something  else came to light they could the Intel  guys and the slot machine they had a lot  of quarters something else happened and  Trump jr. changed to a third story I was  asked to have a meeting with an  individual who I was told might have  information helpful to the campaign this  is a meeting he has denied having a  meeting he apparently has lied about for  at least five months so to Kushner so to  man afford the woman stated that she had  information that individuals connected  to Russia were funding the Democratic  National Committee and supporting Ms  Clinton instead of throwing this  individual out of the building or his  Nixon Attorney General John Mitchell  said about gordon Liddy during Watergate  out of the window he and Kushner and  manna fort met with her for 20 to 30  minutes no details or supporting  information was provided or even offered  it quickly became clear that she had no  meaningful information  she then changed subjects that was  juniors problem with the Kremlin  connected lawyer not that she was a  foreign lawyer reportedly trying to pass  him and Kushner and manna Ford and the  Trump campaign damning information in  hopes of nefariously influencing the  outcome of an American election his  problem was that she wasn't passing him  damning information in hopes of  nefariously influencing the outcome  an election or at least that's what he  claims and not incidentally nobody is  explaining three pieces of timing in  this jr. Kushner and the Russia friendly  man afford meet with the Russian lawyer  June 9 mana fort becomes Trump's new  campaign manager June 20 an Associated  Press story that places Trump senior in  Trump Tower for nearly all the day the  meeting took place and the fact we have  already noted here that on June 9 at  4:40 p.m. presumably after that meeting  truck tweets for the first time about  Hillary Clinton's 33,000 emails that you  deleted while Trump senior was at the  g20 summit again denying the  incontrovertible fact that our  intelligence agencies are confident they  have firm evidence the Russians  interfered with our elections last year  like meeting with Trump's son Trump's  son-in-law and Trump's soon-to-be  campaign manager in Trump Tower 13  months ago while Trump was again  reportedly accepting the meaningless  denials from a murderous dictator and  pledging to quote move forward and  working constructively with Russia while  Trump was proposing or listening to  Putin's proposal for this joint  cybersecurity let the Russian Fox Guard  the American n house deal while Trump  fiddled for Putin's pleasure news broke  that our nuclear power and energy  related computer networks were burned  hacked and all initial evidence shows  this was done by Russia again and this  this darkest most cynical most disloyal  most evil action ever committed by any  president or significant leader in our  nation's history this atrocity Trump has  somehow managed to escalate even this to  something worse Trump is literally  virtually simultaneously accepting the  claim that the Russians did not  interfere with the election last year  while saying that President Obama was  derelict in his duties for not punishing  Russia for what Trump thinks Russia did  not do in his criminality escalated to  madness  Trump has now done everything except to  ask Vladimir Putin to clear and publicly  Sunday morning Trump's first campaign  manager mr. Lewandowski said he knows  that the Russians  not violate our election because  Vladimir Putin says so  Trump quoting Lewandowski pressed him  very tough to find out if Russia had  anything to do with the outcome of the  u.s. election and from what Vladimir  Putin has said the answer is no so now I  think the issue is officially dead like  so many of Putin's opponents and happily  after this cascade of criminally stupid  confessions by two different men named  Donald Trump officially dead like the  long term prospects for the survival of  this presidency resist remove peace

